      "contract": "Only with valid tracing settings does startTracing set WORKFLOW_TRACE_MODE=continuous and register W3C plus RunContextPropagator. App build wrapper imports tracing before the dynamic application graph, including Workflow handlers. The bounded Mikka propagator adds IDs; W3C supplies ancestry. Tracing disabled or failed initialization is outside this guarantee."
    },
