        "lib/tracing/labels.ts:32"
      ],
      "contract": "Inline executeStep creates ordinary child spans and runs the body inside SDK step metadata ALS. Queue-dispatched steps carry the current carrier back through the same workflow consumer. Mikka workflowStepRoute labels metadata only; it does not replace parent context or create a root."
    },
